  "content": "<h1>Aimz - 微型RPG準星</h1><p><span style=\"font-size:24px\">簡介</span></p><p>這是一款專為我的 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/modpacks/darkrpg\" rel=\"nofollow\">DarkRPG</a> 模組包設計的自訂準星。現已獨立發布。</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"font-size:24px\">說明</span></p><p>此模組將原版的標準準星改為更小巧的設計，可進一步提升您的原版遊戲體驗，非常適合在PVP或RPG環境中使用，亦適用於單人遊戲或一般伺服器。</p><p><br>想尋找更多準星、字型或資源包？請查看我的其他作品<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/gamerpotion/projects\" rel=\"nofollow\">這裡</a></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/776/794/2023-12-19_01.png\" width=\"1125\" height=\"447\">&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">立即獲取伺服器並與朋友同樂！點擊<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.bisecthosting.com%252fgamerpotion\" rel=\"nofollow\">此處</a>或下方橫幅，並使用代碼 <strong>GAMERPOTION</strong> 即可享75折優惠！</span></p><p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.bisecthosting.com%252fgamerpotion\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1068/671/53840b7f-f250-4a97-8995-c3544ae3e296.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1086\" height=\"180\"></a></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://discord.gg/uCPfPBvsRJ\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/958/418/join-discord.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"598\" height=\"187\"></a></p><p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fko-fi.com%252fgamerpotion\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/958/419/kofi.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"604\" height=\"165\"></a></p>",
